      "writtenOn": "2020-11-04T21:45:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why, and how do we know when to use one versus the other? They always seem to work the same for me, and it really seems like a mistake that there are two almost identical ways to include\n\nI am fine having a standard and sticking to it, we just need to define it",
