      "writtenOn": "2020-11-04T21:56:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, \"system/library headers\" go in pointy brackets, and your application\u0027s headers in quotes.  The ordering is system/library headers, in alphabetical order, then a blank line, then your program\u0027s headers.\n\nZephyr\u0027s headers most closely correspond to \"system/library\" headers here, and would make that consistent with existing platform/ec conventions... I can add this to the shimming how-to doc so it\u0027s documented.",
      "parentUuid": "fba3b4b0_267cb01c",
